{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18995","headline":"始闻蝉有怀白宾客去岁白有闻蝉见寄诗云秖应催我老兼遣报君知之句 · 刘禹锡","name":"始闻蝉有怀白宾客去岁白有闻蝉见寄诗云秖应催我老兼遣报君知之句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝉韵极清切，始闻何处悲。\n人含不平意，景值欲秋时。\n此岁方晼晚，谁家无别离。\n君言催我老，已是去年诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}